id: pm-rl-worstcohort
title: Refuse promotion when a protected task cohort regresses
description: "Extend the existing predeclared evaluation plan with selected cohort evidence minimums and exact nonregression limits, typed SDK and compact CLI reports. Retain existing promotion, provenance, contamination and shadow gates. Validate with seeded state models, interleavings, packed hosts and a read-only public tracker replay."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: cohorts,guardrails,promotion
created_at: "2026-10-28T23:24:25.192Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-29T00:33:06.760Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Higher aggregate mean cannot override a failed protected cohort; definitions and limits are sealed before collection; insufficient independent samples refuse; leakage checks remain independent
parent: pm-rl-apvf
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T23:24:44.871Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against current CLI and sibling pm-jev, pm-evidence, pm-swarm, pm-rlm and pm-ops sources: no protected-cohort admission gate found. Existing evaluation plans, paired baselines, balanced-intake objectives, contamination and shadow checks own distinct properties. Extend the existing sealed plan and promotion hook; no label reinterpretation or replacement gate. Use pinned SDK complete reads, verified creation history, native leases and explicit relationship unsets; no import/export/sync adapter or recovery journal is introduced."
  "2026-10-28T23:36:40.070Z",codex-agent,"Implemented optional protected cohorts on the existing sealed fixed-stop evaluation contract. Aggregate improvement stays visible and required; cohort evidence counts independent units and uses inclusive exact rational regression comparisons in original reward units. Registration/evidence writers share SDK lease fencing, and writes explicitly unset ambient parent/sprint/release/blocker scope and clear dependencies. Focused CLI, leakage-independence and every-SDK-step competing-writer tests pass; 500 seeded state sequences are running."
  "2026-10-28T23:47:39.688Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof in an isolated disposable source copy: disabling only the protected-cohort decision makes the higher-aggregate regression fail with an assertion; restoring it passes. The 500 seeded state sequences passed, as did 500 exact-boundary trials in both directions and SDK-step competing declaration/evidence writers. Public read-only replay: 111 tasks, 21 active by SDK registry roles, candidate mean 0.8108108108108106 versus 0.18918918918918923, protected improvement -1, refused. Source digest unchanged; JSON 1236 bytes, TOON 1016 bytes. Initial packed acceptance passes npm global, Bun global, npx, forced-Bun bunx and project-local hosts on CLI 2026.10.28. Raised the declared minimum host to the pinned SDK 2026.10.25 for fenced leases; the development dependency pin is unchanged."
  "2026-10-28T23:55:11.940Z",codex-agent,"The pinned pm-linked targeted run passed 37 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, in 305206 ms. Typecheck, test compilation, targeted lint, zero-duplicate and docstring checks pass. Local strict health reports pm-github host-version skew between 2026.10.25 and 2026.10.28 plus a pre-existing provenance advisory; history integrity passes. No foreign extension state, provenance history or dependency pin was repaired. Fresh CI health and unchanged npm/Bun release gates remain required."
  "2026-10-28T23:56:33.085Z",codex-agent,"Final packed artifact passes all five installed hosts (npm global, Bun global, npx, forced-Bun bunx, project-local), each with the same measured replay and unchanged read-only source digest. Archive SHA-256: 2269ce392e36a7fad52759c3ab06ee5ec4acf3d8fb9bc04aa72f8d226e2a7320. Changelog generation/check pass. Claim released for orchestrator verification; item remains in progress and is not closed. Full release-gate evidence is delegated to fresh CI at the final PR head."
  "2026-10-29T00:33:06.759Z",codex-agent,"CI handoff under the queue rules' 30-minute wait cap: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/40790812979 for implementation c523529c82103019d67f24f02dc2477504b35624 is still in progress. All three fresh tracker-health checks passed. Release jobs test (22), test (26) and Bun release (26) remain in progress: 0 of 3 completed, with no final test/coverage counts available. Local targeted evidence is 37 passed with zero skips/failures; packed acceptance is 5 of 5 hosts. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/118 is ready for review and unmerged. This receipt changes tracker evidence only; final-head CI remains pending. Do not treat pending checks as approval. Claim is released and the item remains open for orchestrator verification."
